{"seq":1,"slug":"tier-bom-package-combine","title":"档位 BOM、包材规格与多档合并发货","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdfunding-reward-fulfillment/reward-pack-ship/tier-bom-package-combine","wordCount":2884,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"档位-bom-包材规格与多档合并发货\">档位 BOM、包材规格与多档合并发货</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-从档位到可发货单元\">核心概念：从档位到可发货单元</h2><p>众筹的回报档位（reward tier）在页面上是一句话——「超级早鸟 · 一套 + 全部解锁配件」——但在履约系统里，它必须被展开成一棵<strong>物料清单（BOM, bill of materials）</strong>，否则仓库不知道要往箱子里放什么。这里最容易踩的坑是把「档位」直接当成 SKU：档位是<strong>面向支持者的售卖单位</strong>，SKU 是<strong>面向仓库的库存单位</strong>，两者既不是一对一，也不共享生命周期。同一档位可能在不同批次发货时对应不同的 SKU 组合（赠品换供应商、配件版本迭代），而同一 SKU 又会被多个档位共享。</p>\n<p>正确的建模是三层映射：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>档位（Tier）</strong> — 售卖单位，用户在下单时选择，价格、限量、解锁条件都挂在它上面。</li>\n<li><strong>奖励项（Reward Item）</strong> — 档位内容的一次原子描述，例如「主机 ×1」「收纳包 ×1」「数字兑换码 ×1」。它是<strong>业务语义</strong>，不含具体实物版本。</li>\n<li><strong>实物 SKU</strong> — 仓库里可盘点、可拣货的最小单位，带供应商、批次、版本号。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>档位到实物 SKU 的映射就是 BOM 展开。BOM 不是静态的，它随<strong>履约批次（batch）<strong>变化，因此工程上要把它建模为「档位 × 批次 → SKU 列表」而不是「档位 → SKU 列表」。一个数字奖励（PDF、激活码、社区身份）在 BOM 里必须被显式标记为</strong>非实物项</strong>，它不占箱内空间、不计入体积重，但要在发货确认消息里出现——否则支持者会以为漏发了。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BOM</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>items</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>digital</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BOM}(t, b) = \\{(sku_i, q_i) \\mid i \\in \\text{items}(t,b)\\} \\cup \\{(code_j, 1) \\mid j \\in \\text{digital}(t)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BOM</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6986em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">items</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">digital</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实物项与非实物项分离还决定了对账口径：实物项的已发货由物流单号证明，非实物项的已发货由发放记录（邮件发送、平台内已读）证明，两者不能共用同一个状态机。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;档位 Tier&lt;br/&gt;用户可见的售卖单位&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;奖励项展开&lt;br/&gt;Reward Item&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;是否实物&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|实物| D[&quot;实物 SKU 列表&lt;br/&gt;主机/配件/包装&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|非实物| E[&quot;数字发放项&lt;br/&gt;兑换码/PDF/身份&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;按批次绑定版本&lt;br/&gt;Tier x Batch -&gt; SKU&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;拣货清单 Pick List&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;装箱决策&lt;br/&gt;合并/拆分&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;发货确认&lt;br/&gt;物流单号 + 发放记录&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[\"档位 Tier&lt;br/&gt;用户可见的售卖单位\"] --&gt; B[\"奖励项展开&lt;br/&gt;Reward Item\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"是否实物\"}\n    C --&gt;|实物| D[\"实物 SKU 列表&lt;br/&gt;主机/配件/包装\"]\n    C --&gt;|非实物| E[\"数字发放项&lt;br/&gt;兑换码/PDF/身份\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"按批次绑定版本&lt;br/&gt;Tier x Batch -&gt; SKU\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"拣货清单 Pick List\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"装箱决策&lt;br/&gt;合并/拆分\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"发货确认&lt;br/&gt;物流单号 + 发放记录\"]\n    E --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"包材规格与体积重-计费重量才是成本中心\">包材规格与体积重：计费重量才是成本中心</h2><p>跨境履约的运费不是按物理重量收的，而是按<strong>计费重量（chargeable weight）</strong> = max(实际重量, 体积重量)。体积重量把「箱子有多大」直接翻译成钱，所以在众筹这种「主机 + 一堆配件」的场景里，包材选型的第一约束往往不是保护性够不够，而是<strong>箱内空腔率（void rate）</strong>。</p>\n<p>体积重的通用公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>dim</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{dim}} = \\frac{L \\times W \\times H}{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dim</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是承运商规定的除数（DIM divisor）。英寸-磅制下，UPS 与 FedEx 在美国国内及多数国际包裹服务上采用 139（in³/lb），DHL 快递采用公制的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5000</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>kg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5000\\ \\text{cm}^3/\\text{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg</span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为基准除数（DHL《Volumetric Weight》说明）。除数越小，同样的箱子算出来的体积重越大——这就是为什么「换一个刚好合身的箱子」在跨境运费上的收益常常超过「换一家承运商」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>承运商 / 服务</th>\n<th>体积重除数</th>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>UPS 包裹（美国国内）</td>\n<td>139</td>\n<td>in³/lb</td>\n<td>每件按实际尺寸计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FedEx Express / Ground</td>\n<td>139</td>\n<td>in³/lb</td>\n<td>尺寸向上取整到整数英寸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DHL Express</td>\n<td>5000</td>\n<td>cm³/kg</td>\n<td>公制基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>航空货运（IATA 基准）</td>\n<td>6000</td>\n<td>cm³/kg</td>\n<td>相当于 166 in³/lb</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海运拼箱（LCL）</td>\n<td>按 W/M 计费</td>\n<td>m³ 或吨</td>\n<td>取体积与重量较大者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两点工程细节常被忽略。第一，承运商对每一边<strong>向上取整</strong>后才计算体积，所以把箱子尺寸从 12.1 in 压到 11.9 in 能省掉整整一英寸的体积。第二，计费重量在<strong>分子单(multi-piece shipment)</strong> 时是逐件计算的，一件体积重 8 kg 的箱子和两件各 4.5 kg 的箱子总额不同——这让合并发货的收益不是单调的（见下节）。</p>\n<p>包材规格本身应被建模为<strong>数据</strong>而非散落在拣货规则里的常量：箱型表（内尺寸、外尺寸、自重、成本、最大承重）、缓冲材料表、以及每个 SKU 的可装箱体积。行业保护性验证通常引用 ISTA（International Safe Transit Association）系列协议，包裹运输场景对应 ISTA 3A，亚马逊对自带包装发货有 ISTA 6-Amazon.com SIOC 测试要求——引用这些协议的意义是把包装够不够结实从主观判断变成可复现的实验室条件。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>slack</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>carton</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{slack}} = 1 - \\frac{\\sum_i v_i}{V_{\\text{carton}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slack</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2757em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">carton</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>slack</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{slack}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slack</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是空腔率。空腔率过高有两个代价：体积重虚高，以及箱内物品在运输中晃动导致破损。一个好的目标是让空腔率落在 10%–25% 之间——既能吸收缓冲材料的体积，又不至于为了刚好而牺牲保护性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多档合并发货-把装箱变成一个决策问题\">多档合并发货：把装箱变成一个决策问题</h2><p>众筹履约里有一个电商不常见的现象：<strong>同一个支持者往往认投了多个档位或加了多个 add-on</strong>。例如他可能既认投了「双人套装」，又单独加购了两条肩带。如果仓库按档位分别发货，同一个收件地址会收到三个包裹——运费、清关、客服投诉全部翻倍。合并发货的收益是显著的，但它不是「能合就合」：合并会放大单件的体积重、可能触发更高的关税档、也可能让一个早备好的档位被一个晚到的 add-on 拖住。</p>\n<p>合并决策本质是一个<strong>受约束的装箱问题</strong>。给定一个支持者的所有待发未发项（pledge items + add-ons），在候选箱型中选择一组箱子，使得计费重量之和最小，且满足：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个箱子内物品体积之和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span> 箱内容积（乘一个安全系数）</li>\n<li>单箱总重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span> 承运商/人社的限重（跨境个人包裹常受目的地国低值免税与限重约束）</li>\n<li>不违反<strong>不可合并约束</strong>（如危险品、电池必须独立包装，温控品不可与常温品混装）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>∗</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>charge</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> compat</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min*{x} \\sum*{k} W*{\\text{charge}}(k) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\sum*{i \\in k} v*i \\le V_k,\\ \\sum*{i \\in k} w_i \\le W^{\\max}\\_k,\\ \\text{compat}(i,j)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">charge</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7955em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">compat</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一版实现通常用启发式（首次适应递减，FFD），把体积最大的物品先放，再回落小件；只有在候选箱型多、支持者组合复杂时才需要精确求解。工程上更重要的是<strong>决策的稳定性</strong>：同一个支持者的合并结果不能因为系统重跑而变化，否则仓库会收到两个互相矛盾的拣货单。可行的做法是把合并分组的结果<strong>物化</strong>成一张不可变的装箱单（packing list），带版本号，重算时生成新版本而不是就地修改。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;收集待发项&lt;br/&gt;pledge + add-on&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;是否同一地址&lt;br/&gt;且未发货&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| Z[&quot;各自独立发货&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C{&quot;是否全部就绪&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|否,且策略=尽快| D[&quot;就地拆单&lt;br/&gt;先发已就绪部分&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[&quot;候选箱型搜索&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;计算各方案计费重&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G{&quot;满足限重与&lt;br/&gt;兼容约束&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| E&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[&quot;选出最小计费重方案&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;物化装箱单&lt;br/&gt;带版本号&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;拣货 -&gt; 打包 -&gt; 出货&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; K[&quot;按装箱单关单&lt;br/&gt;逐项标记已发&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"收集待发项&lt;br/&gt;pledge + add-on\"] --&gt; B{\"是否同一地址&lt;br/&gt;且未发货\"}\n    B --&gt;|否| Z[\"各自独立发货\"]\n    B --&gt;|是| C{\"是否全部就绪\"}\n    C --&gt;|否,且策略=尽快| D[\"就地拆单&lt;br/&gt;先发已就绪部分\"]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[\"候选箱型搜索\"]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"计算各方案计费重\"]\n    F --&gt; G{\"满足限重与&lt;br/&gt;兼容约束\"}\n    G --&gt;|否| E\n    G --&gt;|是| H[\"选出最小计费重方案\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"物化装箱单&lt;br/&gt;带版本号\"]\n    I --&gt; J[\"拣货 -&gt; 打包 -&gt; 出货\"]\n    J --&gt; K[\"按装箱单关单&lt;br/&gt;逐项标记已发\"]</pre><p>图中 <code>C → D</code> 的「拆单降级」是必然要有的分支。众筹的到货时间天然离散，把所有 add-on 都等齐再发货会让支持者等上数月，这在本 hub 的姊妹主题 <a href=\"../reward-delay-risk-brand/delay-cause-communication\">延期成因分类与沟通节奏</a> 里有专门讨论。正确的做法是给合并策略一个<strong>可配置的等待窗口</strong>：就绪项超过窗口仍未合并，就按当前就绪集合发货，剩余项进入下一批。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拆分发货与部分履约的状态机\">拆分发货与部分履约的状态机</h2><p>合并的对偶是拆分。当一次支持者的履约被拆成多个包裹时，订单状态不能再是二值的「已发货/未发货」，必须变成<strong>按项计数的部分履约</strong>。这要求履行单元（fulfillment unit）成为第一类对象：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个待发项有独立状态：待备货 / 已入库 / 已装箱 / 已出货 / 已妥投</li>\n<li>一份支持者订单的状态由<strong>其所有项状态聚合</strong>得出，而不是全局覆盖</li>\n<li>发货确认的触发以「本次装箱单出货」为单位，而非「订单完成」</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个模型的直接好处是客服可解释性：主机已发出、肩带将在下批补发，比订单处理中有用得多。它也是退款与纠纷判定的基础——部分履约订单不能整单退款，必须能定位到未发货的项。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>OrderState</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>state</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>items</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>全妥投</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>DONE</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>部分出货</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>PARTIAL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{OrderState} = f\\big(\\{\\text{state}(i) \\mid i \\in \\text{items}\\}\\big), \\qquad f(\\text{全妥投})=\\text{DONE},\\ f(\\text{部分出货})=\\text{PARTIAL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OrderState</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">state</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6986em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">items</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全妥投</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DONE</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">部分出货</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PARTIAL</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>状态机与装箱单必须同源</strong>：装箱单出货时，写回的不是「订单已发货」这一个标志，而是逐项把该装箱单覆盖的项标记为已出货，并把未覆盖的项留给下一批。这样即使同一订单被拆成三次发货，每一次都只关掉它真正包含的项，不会出现已经发过的东西被重复发出——这是众筹履约里最昂贵的错误之一，因为补发一件实物跨境件的成本往往超过该档位的毛利。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据模型与对账\">数据模型与对账</h2><p>把上面几节收敛成可落地的表结构，核心是四张表加一张物化装箱单：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>关键字段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Tier</td>\n<td>tier_id, batch_id, title</td>\n<td>档位按批次实例化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TierBOM</td>\n<td>tier_id, batch_id, sku_id, qty, is_digital</td>\n<td>BOM 展开，含非实物项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sku</td>\n<td>sku_id, dims, weight, hs_code, is_hazmat</td>\n<td>尺寸/重量/HS 编码驱动装箱与清关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CartonType</td>\n<td>carton_id, inner_dims, max_weight, cost</td>\n<td>包材规格表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PackingList</td>\n<td>pl_id, pledge_id, version, carton_ids, items</td>\n<td>物化装箱单，不可变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对账逻辑建立在装箱单的<strong>不可变性</strong>上：对账时比较装箱单声明的项集合与物流单号回传的妥投记录，差异即异常（少发、多发、错发）。由于装箱单带版本号，任何重算都会产生新版本而不是覆盖旧版本，因此历史对账永远能复现当时的决策。HS 编码（协调制度，由世界海关组织 WCO 维护）在这里由 SKU 携带并随装箱单流入报关数据，是下一章 <a href=\"../reward-customs-declare/declared-value-hs-code\">回报品申报价值、HS 编码与随货清单建模</a> 的输入。</p>\n<p>一个常被低估的一致性约束：<strong>SKU 的尺寸与重量必须在入库时实测，而不是沿用供应商标称值。</strong> 标称尺寸经常与实际不符，而体积重对每一维度都敏感——标称少 2 cm，一批货的运费可能就多算几个百分点。因此 SKU 表里应有 <code>dims_source</code> 字段区分标称与实测，并在装箱决策中只信任实测值；未实测的 SKU 走保守估算，并在入库后回填。这个字段是「预估运费 vs 实付运费」系统性偏差的根因之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>档位 BOM、包材规格与多档合并发货，本质是同一件事的三个视角：<strong>BOM 决定「要发什么」</strong>（档位 × 批次展开成实物 SKU 与非实物发放项），<strong>包材与体积重决定「发一次花多少钱」</strong>（计费重量取实际重与体积重的较大者，除数由承运商规定），<strong>合并与拆分决定「一次发多少」</strong>。三者的公共枢纽是那张带版本号的不可变装箱单——它把拣货、打包、出货、清关、对账串成一条可复现的链路。工程上守住三条底线：BOM 按批次绑定而非按档位写死；SKU 尺寸以实测为准；部分履约以项为单位而非以订单为单位。做到这三点，众筹履约里最昂贵的三类错误——漏发、重发、运费虚高——就都有了结构性的防线。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"档位 BOM、包材规格与多档合并发货","id":"档位-bom-包材规格与多档合并发货"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从档位到可发货单元","id":"核心概念-从档位到可发货单元"},{"level":2,"text":"包材规格与体积重：计费重量才是成本中心","id":"包材规格与体积重-计费重量才是成本中心"},{"level":2,"text":"多档合并发货：把装箱变成一个决策问题","id":"多档合并发货-把装箱变成一个决策问题"},{"level":2,"text":"拆分发货与部分履约的状态机","id":"拆分发货与部分履约的状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"数据模型与对账","id":"数据模型与对账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Late Pledge、加购变更与地址修改的处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdfunding-reward-fulfillment/reward-tier-pledge/late-pledge-address-change"},"next":{"title":"批次波次发货计划与库存分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdfunding-reward-fulfillment/reward-pack-ship/batch-wave-inventory-alloc"}}